    <briefdescription>
<para>The accelerator tables are designed to allow efficient random access (using a symbol name as a key) into debug info by providing an index of the debug info DIEs. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class implements the common functionality of Apple and DWARF 5 accelerator tables. TODO: Generalize the rest of the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_apple_accelerator_table" kindref="compound">AppleAcceleratorTable</ref> interface and move it to this class. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
